  "notes": [
    "Nintendo Japan labels three axes 縦 49.5 / 横 38.5 / 高さ 45.0. Because 高さ (height) is labelled separately, 縦 is read as the front-to-back length: width=38.5 (横), height=45.0 (高さ), depth=49.5 (縦). The Australian page prints the same three numbers unlabelled (secondary, covers nothing). Size excludes the AC plug and the detachable USB-C cable (excludes_projections=true).",
    "Four USB PD rails, all 3.0 A: output_voltage_v / output_current_a hold the highest (20.0 V / 3.0 A); output_rails holds all four as printed. The cable is detachable from the adapter ('ACアダプターと着脱可能'), so output_connector is the plug of that USB-C cable. model_numbers NGN-01 from Nintendo's EU ecodesign page ('External power supply model: NGN-01', the Switch 2 AC adapter)."
  ]
